<div class="prose max-w-prose">

Pilotis already had a brand foundation in place, but it needed to be refined,
extended, and brought into clearer focus. I worked closely with the team to
develop the brand further rather than starting from scratch — tightening the
story, strengthening the visual language, and creating a more cohesive system
that could support the product as it grew.

## Building on an existing identity

The brief was not to reinvent Pilotis, but to help it feel more confident,
consistent, and commercially clear. That meant reviewing what already worked,
identifying where the brand felt fragmented, and extending it in a way that
could scale across the platform.

The result was a more thoughtful brand system — one that felt aligned with the
product, more credible to customers, and stronger as a foundation for digital
experiences.

## The website

I built the Pilotis website in Webflow, using the strengthened brand direction
to create a clear, conversion-focused experience. The site needed to explain the
platform quickly, communicate value clearly, and give visitors a sense of the
product story without overwhelming them.

The build was shaped around clarity and trust: strong messaging, thoughtful
layout, and a polished digital presence that helped the brand feel more mature
and established online.

## Pilotis Forms launch

A major milestone for the project was the launch of Pilotis Forms in July 2026.
This was not just a visual rollout — I also ran the entire marketing strategy
and launch campaign for the product.

That included the positioning, launch messaging, campaign planning, and the
digital roll-out to support the go-live. The goal was to position Pilotis Forms
as a clear product proposition within the wider platform and create momentum
around the launch.

## Why it mattered

This project was about extending an existing brand into a stronger, more
coherent digital presence while also supporting a significant product launch.
It brought together strategy, design, web build, and marketing execution in one
continuous effort.

Explore the platform here: [Pilotis.com](https://pilotis.com)

